~ seekend
if GameState.SeekWin
	Ben: I found all my friends! Hooray!
	do get_tree().change_scene_to_file("res://Scenes/AppartmentWorld.tscn")
else
	Ben: [speed=0.2]I can't find all my friends...
	do get_tree().change_scene_to_file("res://Scenes/AppartmentWorld.tscn")
=> END